{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>9to5Mac 由 CleanMyMac by MacPaw 呈獻。隨住 macOS 27 Golden Gate 推出，記得先用 CleanMyMac 釋放空間、優化系統，確保你部新 Mac 由第一日起就發揮 100% 效能。了解更多。</p>\n<p>macOS 27 Golden Gate 相比 macOS 26 Tahoe 係一次重大升級，唔單止係因為設計決策更加明智。就好似 iPhone 嘅 iOS 27 一樣，Mac 今次加入咗 Liquid Glass 外觀滑桿，等你可以大幅改變成個系統嘅視覺風格。</p>\n<h2>外觀滑桿</h2>\n<p>Liquid Glass 係 Apple 嘅設計語言，最初喺 iOS 26 同 macOS 26 Tahoe 開始採用。Liquid Glass 一開始只有單一種外觀，Apple 之後先加入設定，等 Liquid Glass 可以冇咁透明。</p>\n<p>由 iOS 27 同 macOS 27 Golden Gate 開始，Liquid Glass 再唔止係兩種風格。Apple 引入咗外觀滑桿，等你可以將 Liquid Glass 調得比以往更加透明，亦可以畀佢更朦朧嘅外觀，但依然保持現代感。</p>\n<p>macOS 27 Golden Gate 預設係中等設定，喺初次設定時系統亦會邀請你調整滑桿。你之後亦可以喺「系統設定」&gt;「外觀」入面再調整。</p>\n<p>Liquid Glass 滑桿會即時預覽每個設定嘅效果，三個刻度分別代表最透明、中等同最朦朧。當然，你亦可以喺刻度之間自由調整任何程度。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-System-Settings-Ultraclear.webp?w=800\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-System-Settings-Default.webp?w=800\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-System-Settings-Fully-Tinted.webp?w=800\"/>\n<h2>Dock 欄</h2>\n<p>Dock 欄係最明顯會隨住 Liquid Glass 滑桿設定而改變外觀嘅元素。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Ultraclear.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Default.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Fully-Tinted.webp\"/>\n<p>佢嘅範圍可以由清晰顯示你嘅桌面壁紙，去到更加朦朧同實在嘅材質效果。</p>\n<p>以下係更仔細嘅睇法：</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Ultraclear.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Default.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Fully-Tinted.webp\"/>\n<h2>小工具</h2>\n<p>macOS 桌面小工具可以係全彩色、暗色，或者自動切換。Liquid Glass 滑桿亦會改變暗色小工具嘅外觀。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Widgets-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Widgets-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Widgets-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<h2>Apple Music 同 Podcast</h2>\n<p>Apple Music 同 Podcast 等有系統「播放中」 bar 嘅應用程式，會因為 Liquid Glass 滑桿嘅位置而有好大分別嘅外觀。</p>\n<p>以下係 Podcast 嘅「播放中」 bar 例子：</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Now-Playing-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Now-Playing-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Now-Playing-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<p>而以下係 Music：</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Music-Now-Playing-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Music-Now-Playing-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Music-Now-Playing-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<h2>更多內容</h2>\n<p>滑桿亦會套用喺側邊欄、工具列同工具列按鈕，改變「照片」、Safari 等有視窗介面嘅應用程式嘅外觀。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Photos-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Photos-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Photos-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<p>macOS 27 Golden Gate Liquid Glass 滑桿嘅一點係，單一條滑桿控制成個系統嘅 Liquid Glass 外觀，即係話 Dock、小工具同視窗介面都會係同一個風格。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Additional-01.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Additional-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Additional-03.webp\"/>\n<p>你鍾意邊種？更透明、更朦朧，定係中間？講個人感受，我自己就好鍾意喺 Mac 上用更朦朧嘅選項，感覺好成熟。但調較去更透明都好有趣，我好高興 macOS 27 Golden Gate 畀大家自行揀。</p>\n<p>歡迎喺留言區分享你嘅想法！</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/CMM-Body-Image-1.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-24T02:59:33.833629+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1196,"images":25,"source":"9to5Mac","fallback":"none"}}